{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/decision-makers-guide-abbreviations-staff-guide","content_id":"5e9d79a5-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","description":"Guidance for DWP decision makers – abbreviations used in the guide.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"accessible.formats@dwp.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"67ffac49b73354468d13553f","filename":"dmg-abbreviations.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":112115,"filename":"dmg-abbreviations.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"8870821","isbn":"","number_of_pages":17,"title":"DMG abbreviations","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/67ffac49b73354468d13553f/dmg-abbreviations.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"accessible.formats@dwp.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"66e18c8f951c1776394a0007","filename":"dmg-statutes.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":52014,"filename":"dmg-statutes.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"8870822","isbn":"","number_of_pages":5,"title":"DMG abbreviations for statutes","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/66e18c8f951c1776394a0007/dmg-statutes.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"accessible.formats@dwp.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"68d6a9b8dadf7616351e4b1a","filename":"dmg-si-abbreviations.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":258529,"filename":"dmg-si-abbreviations.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"8870823","isbn":"","number_of_pages":14,"title":"DMG abbreviations for statutory instruments","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68d6a9b8dadf7616351e4b1a/dmg-si-abbreviations.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"accessible.formats@dwp.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"66fbf4c3a31f45a9c765ef55","filename":"dmg-si-abbreviations-summary-of-changes.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":166727,"filename":"dmg-si-abbreviations-summary-of-changes.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"8870824","isbn":"","number_of_pages":1,"title":"Summary of changes to DMG abbreviations ","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/66fbf4c3a31f45a9c765ef55/dmg-si-abbreviations-summary-of-changes.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This guidance is for <abbr title=\"Department for Work and Pensions\">DWP</abbr> staff who make decisions about benefits and pensions. It helps them make decisions that are accurate and consistent.</p>\n\n<p>The introduction of Universal Credit and Personal Independence Payment affects the guidance <abbr title=\"Department for Work and Pensions\">DWP</abbr> staff use.</p>\n\n<p><abbr title=\"Department for Work and Pensions\">DWP</abbr> decision makers now use <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/advice-for-decision-making-staff-guide\">Advice for decision making</a> (instead of the <abbr title=\"Decision makers’ guide\">DMG</abbr>) for decisions that involve:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Universal Credit</li>\n  <li>Personal Independence Payment</li>\n  <li>contribution-based Jobseeker’s Allowance and contribution-based Employment and Support Allowance for <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/universal-credit/eligibility\">people who are eligible for Universal Credit</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"why-we-publish-this-guide\">Why we publish this guide</h2>\n\n<p>We publish this guide to help people understand how we make decisions.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"information-for-claimants\">Information for claimants</h2>\n\n<p>Information for claimants about eligibility and how to claim:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/browse/benefits\">benefits</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/browse/working/state-pension\">pensions</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Updated DMG abbreviations for statutory instruments.","public_timestamp":"2025-10-01T08:30:02Z"},{"note":"Updated 'DMG abbreviations for statutory instruments'.","public_timestamp":"2025-09-05T13:58:37Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG abbreviations for statutory instruments.","public_timestamp":"2025-06-23T10:41:48Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG abbreviations and DMG abbreviations for statutory instruments.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-16T14:53:08Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG abbreviations.","public_timestamp":"2025-02-20T14:54:11Z"},{"note":"Summary of changes to DMG abbreviations and DMG abbreviations for statutory instruments have been updated. ","public_timestamp":"2024-10-02T10:15:01Z"},{"note":"DMG abbreviations and DMG abbreviations for statutes have been updated. ","public_timestamp":"2024-09-11T13:23:51Z"},{"note":"Updated DMG abbreviations and also DMG abbreviations for statutory instruments. ","public_timestamp":"2023-12-08T17:26:32Z"},{"note":"Published an updated version of the DMG abbreviations document. The abbreviation nPES (New Payment Exemption Service) has been added to the list of abbreviations.","public_timestamp":"2023-09-07T08:49:37Z"},{"note":"DMG abbreviations for statutory instruments attachment updated.","public_timestamp":"2023-06-28T11:19:18Z"},{"note":"Updated the DMG list of abbreviations to change “Her Majesty” to “Her/His Majesty” in HM, HMF and HMRC.","public_timestamp":"2023-01-04T10:36:32Z"},{"note":"Updated summary of changes and DMG SI abbreviations. ","public_timestamp":"2022-03-25T09:59:40Z"},{"note":"Updated the DWP abbreviations for statutory instruments. The change is described in the summary of changes.",